Package: ICSFun
Title: Coordinate-Free ICS for Functional and Non-Functional Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Camille", "Mondon", email = "camille.mondon@tse-fr.eu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-4569-990X"))
Description: Provides a coordinate-free implementation of Invariant Coordinate
    Selection (ICS) for functional, compositional, and distributional data.
    Includes tools for outlier detection, dimension reduction, and visualization
    of ICS results.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
